{"title": "Bhaal's Edict", "pageid": 30856, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bhaal's_Edict", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Bhaal's Edict</b> is an action available to the <a href=\"/wiki/Boon_of_Bhaal\" title=\"Boon of Bhaal\">Boon of Bhaal</a> during combat with <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Force a creature to become your murderer - if it does not kill another during its next turn, it will die instantly.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Bhaal.27s_Edict\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Bhaal's_Edict\"> Condition: Bhaal's Edict </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict_(Condition)\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Edict\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict_(Condition)\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict (Condition)\">Bhaal's Edict</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>If you don't kill another creature before the end of your next turn, you will die instantly.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Boon_of_Bhaal\" title=\"Boon of Bhaal\">Boon of Bhaal</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Using <a href=\"/wiki/Move_Moonbeam\" title=\"Move Moonbeam\">Move Moonbeam</a> does not count as killing another creature and does not remove the condition. This may be true when casting <a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam\" title=\"Moonbeam\">Moonbeam</a> too. Also, other actions with similar interactions around classifying as \"killing another creature\" may be affected. This may be a result of Moonbeam being considered a summoned entity.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715043007\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1614/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11110/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5974/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 865789/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n129.37%   45.844     18 Template:Trim\n100.00%   35.436      1 -total\n 98.98%   35.073      1 Template:Feature_page\n 22.20%    7.865      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 21.33%    7.558      1 Template:Condition\n 11.67%    4.134      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.86%    3.850      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.95%    3.527      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n  8.45%    2.993      1 Template:Icon_link\n  7.57%    2.682      1 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30856-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715043007 and revision id 350848. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}